  "description": "Reid Ladies Classic | Vintage women's bike\nTimeless vintage style meets modern versatility – the perfect women's bike for comfortable commutes, leisurely rides and everyday adventures.\nThe Reid Bikes Ladies Classic vintage bike combines timeless styling with practical, reliable performance. Built around a lightweight custom Reid steel frame, it delivers a comfortable, stable ride for everything from everyday trips around town to relaxed weekend rides. Kenda 700x35c tyres provide plenty of grip and a smooth ride across a variety of surfaces.\nA Shimano 7-speed drivetrain, Revo shifter and Tourney rear derailleur make changing gears simple, helping you tackle hills and varied terrain with ease. Dual-pivot calliper brakes with alloy comfort levers provide reliable, responsive stopping power and confident control.\nComfort and practicality come as standard, with a plush tan saddle, vintage-style stitched grips and smooth-rolling 700c alloy wheels. A pannier rack, full mudguards, chainguard and kickstand are all included, making the Reid Bikes Ladies Classic vintage bike ready for everyday riding straight out of the box.\nFor an extra touch of vintage style and added carrying capacity, an optional front basket is available – ideal for shopping trips, picnics and everyday essentials.\nWho is the Reid Bikes Ladies Classic for?\nThe Ladies Classic is ideal for:\n\nEveryday riders who love classic styling with modern, reliable performance\n\nComfortable city and leisure rides, from coffee runs and shopping trips to weekend adventures\n\nRiders looking for an easy-to-use bike with 7 gears to tackle hills and changing terrain\n\nCommuters who want a practical, stylish alternative for getting around town\n\nLonger leisurely rides, with a comfortable saddle, ergonomic grips and smooth-rolling 700c tyres\n\nRiders who value practicality, with a pannier rack, mudguards, chainguard and kickstand included as standard\n\nAnyone wanting to add a touch of vintage style, with an optional front basket for carrying everyday essentials",
